        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 3507, Ribbon and Reed Regency Mortise Entrance Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Regency Mortise Entry Set is a beautiful example of the elegance of French Colonial decor. The Regency Mortise Entrance Lockset will fit either 2-1/2 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. The ribbon and reed design will elevate any space without overpowering the quaintness that makes the french colonial style so desirable. Plus, the beautiful detailing on the handle only adds to its loveliness. Customizable, it is available with your choice of knob or lever and any of 7 beautiful finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"2\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"text\">\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Emtek Regency Entryset and the ANSI F20 Heavy Duty Lock Body:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Deadlocking latch bolt with saw-proof inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pick security latch.</li>\r\n<li>When the deadbolt is engaged, the outside thumb press is automatically locked.</li>\r\n<li>The latch bolt is retracted by the knob or lever on either side, except when the outside thumb press is locked by stop button, then it can only be opened from the exterior by use of the key. Making it ideal for doors you want to automatically lock. This feature can be easily toggled on and off by pressing the stop and release button on the mortise box face.</li>\r\n<li>Operating the interior trim retracts both the deadbolt and the latch bolt for emergency egress.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-F20-diagram.jpg?v=1704354539\" width=\"189\" height=\"255\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek F20\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek French Colonial Regency Keyed Entry Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 12-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Trim Center to Center: 3-5/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-3/4\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-3507-specification.pdf?v=1704262345\"><b>Emtek 3507 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-F20-Mortise-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262243\"><b>Emtek ANSI F20 Mortise Box Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-F20-Mortise-Install.pdf?v=1704262243\"><b>Emtek ANSI F20 Mortise Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob/lever operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-3507-finish.jpg?v=1704354770\" width=\"600\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 3507 Available Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Regency Mortise Entry Set",
                "description": "The Regency Mortise Entry Set is a beautiful example of the elegance of French Colonial decor. The Regency Mortise Entrance Lockset will fit either 2-1/2 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. The ribbon and reed design will elevate any space without overpowering the quaintness that makes the french colonial style so desirable. Plus, the beautiful detailing on the handle only adds to its loveliness. Customizable, it is available with your choice of knob or lever and any of 7 beautiful finishes. \r\n",
